{% comment %}
  ============================================================
  AK-MB-PRESTART: Pre-start briefing screen for Mystery Box.

  This section renders NO Liquid DOM of its own. It is a
  JS/CSS orchestrator that injects a styled overlay into the
  EXISTING `.ak-mb-frame` inside the Mystery Box embed at
  runtime, as a sibling of `#akMbIframe` and `#akMbLock`.

  PURPOSE
    A ceremonial, restricted-access "mission briefing" screen
    that orients customers, frames the Combo Pass offer, and
    hands off to the existing iframe flow when START is
    clicked. The actual experience is $20 — the entry ritual
    should read like $1,000.

  SHOPIFY-SIDE ONLY
    - No crate repo changes
    - No edits to the embed custom_liquid JSON string
    - No edits to layout/theme.liquid
    - No edits to sections/ak-mb-release.liquid
    - No iframe src mutation, no iframe reload, no postMessage
    - No backend, entitlement, checkout, fulfillment logic

  RELATIONSHIP TO AK-MB-RELEASE
    Both orchestrators share the same TARGET_UTC constant
    (2026-04-09T07:00:00Z). Pre-release, ak-mb-release owns
    the screen via #akMbLock and ak-mb-prestart early-returns.
    Post-release, ak-mb-release is a no-op and ak-mb-prestart
    owns the screen until START is clicked.

  Z-INDEX LADDER INSIDE .ak-mb-frame
    canvas(0) → stage(2) → stage::before seam(3)
      → .ak-mb-prestart(4)    ← this section
      → .ak-mb-lock(5)        ← release gate (pre-drop only)
      → frame ::before/::after bevel+LED(6)

  DISMISSAL FLOW
    1. User clicks START
    2. Overlay gets .is-dismissing class (200ms opacity fade)
    3. Overlay removed from DOM
    4. iframe.style.pointerEvents restored to 'auto'
    5. User sees the existing iframe tap-to-sound screen and
       proceeds through the unchanged crate flow

  REMOVAL / ROLLBACK
    1. Delete this file.
    2. In templates/page.mystery-box.json, remove the
       "ak-mb-prestart" entry from the `sections` map and
       remove "ak-mb-prestart" from the `order` array.
    3. No other file edits required.

  PHASE 1
    Phase 1 ships Direction A "Classified / Mission Briefing"
    visual treatment ready-to-read premium. Phase 2 follow-
    ups (typewriter reveal, dynamic price via Liquid, session
    dismissal policy, optional stamp watermarks) are deferred
    until Phase 1 is verified on dev.

  COPY CONFIRMATION
    All user-facing strings in this file are draft pending
    business confirmation (price, disclaimer wording, combo
    terms). See TODO: confirm markers below.
  ============================================================
{% endcomment %}

{%- style -%}
/* ============================================================
   AK-MB-PRESTART
   Scoped under .ak-mb-prestart — zero global styles.
   Material continuity: matte bunker housing + single purple accent.
   ============================================================ */

.ak-mb-prestart{
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  z-index:4;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:20px 28px;
  box-sizing:border-box;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#080706 0%,#040403 100%);
  color:#e8e4db;
  font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;
  text-align:center;
  overflow:hidden;
  opacity:0;
  animation:akMbPrestartIn 600ms ease-out forwards;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}
.ak-mb-prestart *{
  box-sizing:border-box;
}
.ak-mb-prestart.is-dismissing{
  opacity:0;
  transition:opacity 200ms ease-out;
  pointer-events:none;
}

/* ----- Atmospheric haze (root ::before) ----- */
.ak-mb-prestart::before{
  content:'';
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 80% at 50% 50%,rgba(255,51,255,0.08) 0%,transparent 70%);
  pointer-events:none;
  z-index:0;
  animation:akMbHazePulse 8s ease-in-out infinite;
}

/* ----- Ambient texture layers (vignette / grain / scanline) ----- */
.ak-mb-prestart__vignette{
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse 85% 72% at center,transparent 32%,rgba(0,0,0,0.62) 100%);
  pointer-events:none;
  z-index:0;
  animation:akMbVignetteBreathe 7s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__grain{
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='160' height='160'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='2' stitchTiles='stitch'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
  background-size:160px 160px;
  opacity:0.08;
  mix-blend-mode:overlay;
  pointer-events:none;
  z-index:1;
  animation:akMbGrainDrift 14s linear infinite;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__scanline{
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent 0px,transparent 3px,rgba(255,255,255,0.07) 3px,rgba(255,255,255,0.07) 4px);
  background-size:100% 160px;
  pointer-events:none;
  z-index:2;
  animation:akMbScanScroll 12s linear infinite;
}

/* ----- Inner content container ----- */
.ak-mb-prestart__inner{
  position:relative;
  z-index:3;
  width:100%;
  max-width:680px;
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  gap:22px;
}

/* ----- Staggered entrance per child ----- */
.ak-mb-prestart__serial,
.ak-mb-prestart__hero,
.ak-mb-prestart__plate,
.ak-mb-prestart__ctas,
.ak-mb-prestart__disclaimer{
  opacity:0;
  transform:translateY(8px);
  animation:akMbPrestartChildRise 560ms ease-out forwards;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__serial{animation-delay:200ms;}
.ak-mb-prestart__hero{animation-delay:280ms;}
.ak-mb-prestart__plate:not(.ak-mb-prestart__plate--data){animation-delay:360ms;}
.ak-mb-prestart__plate.ak-mb-prestart__plate--data{animation-delay:440ms;}
.ak-mb-prestart__ctas{animation-delay:520ms;}
.ak-mb-prestart__disclaimer{animation-delay:600ms;}

/* ----- Top serial strip (physical recessed data bar) ----- */
.ak-mb-prestart__serial{
  position:relative;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:12px;
  padding:8px 18px 7px;
  font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
  font-size:10px;
  letter-spacing:0.24em;
  color:rgba(232,228,219,0.48);
  text-transform:uppercase;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0a0908 0%,#060504 100%);
  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,51,255,0.2);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.75);
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.035),
    inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.78),
    0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.55),
    0 4px 10px -3px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
}
.ak-mb-prestart__serial-dot{
  display:inline-block;
  width:6px;
  height:6px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:#ff33ff;
  margin-right:2px;
  box-shadow:
    0 0 6px rgba(255,51,255,0.78),
    inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.32),
    inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.38),
    0 0 0 2px #040302,
    0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.88);
  animation:akMbPrestartPulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__serial-sep{
  color:rgba(232,228,219,0.18);
}

/* ----- Hero block (kicker / title / subtitle) ----- */
.ak-mb-prestart__hero{
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center;
  gap:8px;
  padding:14px 0 8px;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__kicker{
  font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;
  font-size:11px;
  letter-spacing:0.34em;
  color:rgba(232,228,219,0.42);
  text-transform:uppercase;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__title{
  margin:0;
  font-family:Impact,Haettenschweiler,'Arial Narrow Bold',sans-serif;
  font-size:72px;
  line-height:0.92;
  letter-spacing:0.12em;
  color:#f4f1e9;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  text-shadow:
    0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.92),
    0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.55),
    0 0 22px rgba(255,51,255,0.07);
  animation:akMbTitleGlow 6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__subtitle{
  display:inline-block;
  margin-top:2px;
  padding:5px 16px 4px;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,51,255,0.48);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,51,255,0.16);
  font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
  font-size:11px;
  letter-spacing:0.28em;
  color:#ff33ff;
  text-transform:uppercase;
}

/* ----- Plates (engraved panels: outer drop + inner bevel recess) ----- */
.ak-mb-prestart__plate{
  position:relative;
  padding:18px 22px 14px;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0a0908 0%,#050403 100%);
  border:1px solid #1a1815;
  border-top-color:rgba(255,51,255,0.18);
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.035),
    inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.88),
    0 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.58),
    0 8px 18px -6px rgba(0,0,0,0.72),
    0 0 0 1px rgba(255,51,255,0.06);
  text-align:left;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__plate::before{
  content:'';
  position:absolute;
  inset:2px;
  pointer-events:none;
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.022),
    inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.72);
  z-index:0;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__plate::after{
  content:'';
  position:absolute;
  top:-1px;
  left:0;
  right:0;
  height:2px;
  background:rgba(255,51,255,0.55);
  pointer-events:none;
  z-index:1;
  animation:akMbPlateFlicker 6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
/* Engraved seam — data plate reads as connected to briefing plate above */
.ak-mb-prestart__plate.ak-mb-prestart__plate--data{
  margin-top:-4px;
  border-top-color:rgba(255,51,255,0.26);
}
.ak-mb-prestart__plate-label{
  position:absolute;
  top:-7px;
  left:18px;
  padding:0 8px;
  background:#060504;
  font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;
  font-size:9px;
  letter-spacing:0.28em;
  color:rgba(255,51,255,0.72);
  text-transform:uppercase;
  line-height:1;
  z-index:2;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__plate-body{
  position:relative;
  z-index:1;
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  gap:4px;
}

/* Briefing lines */
.ak-mb-prestart__brief-line{
  position:relative;
  padding-left:18px;
  font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
  font-size:12.5px;
  line-height:1.55;
  color:rgba(232,228,219,0.82);
  letter-spacing:0.035em;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__brief-line::before{
  content:'>';
  position:absolute;
  left:2px;
  top:0;
  color:#ff33ff;
  font-weight:700;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__brief-line a{
  color:#ff33ff;
  text-decoration:underline;
  text-underline-offset:3px;
  text-decoration-thickness:1px;
  transition:color 140ms ease-out;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__brief-line a:hover,
.ak-mb-prestart__brief-line a:focus-visible{
  color:#ff66ff;
  text-decoration-thickness:2px;
}

/* Combo data rows */
.ak-mb-prestart__data-row{
  display:flex;
  align-items:baseline;
  gap:14px;
  padding:5px 0;
  border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.045);
}
.ak-mb-prestart__data-row:last-child{
  border-bottom:none;
  padding-bottom:0;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__data-key{
  flex:0 0 62px;
  font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;
  font-size:9px;
  letter-spacing:0.24em;
  color:rgba(255,51,255,0.62);
  text-transform:uppercase;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__data-val{
  flex:1;
  font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
  font-size:12px;
  color:rgba(244,241,233,0.92);
  letter-spacing:0.05em;
  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__data-val--ok{
  color:#ff33ff;
}

/* ----- CTA row ----- */
.ak-mb-prestart__ctas{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  gap:12px;
  margin-top:6px;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__cta{
  position:relative;
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  gap:4px;
  min-height:66px;
  min-width:220px;
  padding:14px 24px;
  font-family:Impact,Haettenschweiler,'Arial Narrow Bold',sans-serif;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  text-decoration:none;
  cursor:pointer;
  border-radius:1px;
  transition:border-color 160ms ease-out,color 160ms ease-out,transform 140ms ease-out,box-shadow 180ms ease-out;
  -webkit-appearance:none;
  appearance:none;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;
  user-select:none;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__cta--primary{
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#121110 0%,#080706 100%);
  border:1px solid #1c1a17;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,51,255,0.52);
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.072),
    inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.025),
    inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.82),
    inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.35),
    0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.9),
    0 6px 14px -4px rgba(0,0,0,0.65),
    0 0 0 1px rgba(255,51,255,0.12),
    0 0 18px -6px rgba(255,51,255,0.18);
  color:#f4f1e9;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__cta--primary::before{
  content:'';
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.048) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 32%);
  pointer-events:none;
  z-index:0;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__cta--primary::after{
  content:'';
  position:absolute;
  inset:-1px;
  border-radius:1px;
  box-shadow:0 0 22px -4px rgba(255,51,255,0.22);
  pointer-events:none;
  z-index:0;
  opacity:0;
  animation:akMbCtaGlow 5s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__cta--secondary{
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(14,13,11,0.72) 0%,rgba(6,5,4,0.82) 100%);
  border:1px solid #1a1815;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,51,255,0.22);
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.025),
    inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.55),
    0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.72),
    0 5px 12px -4px rgba(0,0,0,0.55),
    0 0 0 1px rgba(255,51,255,0.05);
  color:rgba(232,228,219,0.74);
}
.ak-mb-prestart__cta--secondary::before{
  content:'';
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.022) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 32%);
  pointer-events:none;
  z-index:0;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__cta-label{
  position:relative;
  z-index:1;
  font-size:22px;
  letter-spacing:0.12em;
  line-height:1;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__cta-sub{
  position:relative;
  z-index:1;
  font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
  font-size:10px;
  letter-spacing:0.22em;
  opacity:0.6;
  line-height:1;
  margin-top:2px;
}

/* Hover (desktop only) */
@media (hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){
  .ak-mb-prestart__cta--primary:hover{
    border-top-color:rgba(255,51,255,0.92);
    color:#faf7ec;
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1),
      inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.82),
      inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.35),
      0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.9),
      0 6px 14px -4px rgba(0,0,0,0.65),
      0 0 0 1px rgba(255,51,255,0.38),
      0 0 28px -4px rgba(255,51,255,0.42);
  }
  .ak-mb-prestart__cta--secondary:hover{
    border-top-color:rgba(255,51,255,0.58);
    color:rgba(248,245,236,0.98);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.042),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.55),
      0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.72),
      0 5px 12px -4px rgba(0,0,0,0.55),
      0 0 0 1px rgba(255,51,255,0.2);
  }
}

/* Active (pressed) — real translate + inner recess */
.ak-mb-prestart__cta--primary:active{
  transform:translateY(2px);
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.85),
    inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255,51,255,0.18),
    0 0 0 1px rgba(255,51,255,0.14),
    0 0 12px -4px rgba(255,51,255,0.2);
}
.ak-mb-prestart__cta--secondary:active{
  transform:translateY(2px);
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.68),
    inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.42),
    0 0 0 1px rgba(255,51,255,0.08);
}

/* Focus (keyboard) */
.ak-mb-prestart__cta:focus{
  outline:none;
}
.ak-mb-prestart__cta--primary:focus-visible{
  outline:none;
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.055),
    inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.72),
    0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.82),
    0 0 0 2px rgba(255,51,255,0.58);
}
.ak-mb-prestart__cta--secondary:focus-visible{
  outline:none;
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02),
    inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),
    0 0 0 2px rgba(255,51,255,0.42);
}

/* ----- Bottom disclaimer strip (engraved panel) ----- */
.ak-mb-prestart__disclaimer{
  position:relative;
  margin-top:4px;
  padding:8px 18px 7px;
  font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
  font-size:9px;
  letter-spacing:0.2em;
  color:rgba(232,228,219,0.38);
  text-transform:uppercase;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0a0908 0%,#060504 100%);
  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,51,255,0.14);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.62);
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.025),
    inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.68),
    0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.52),
    0 4px 10px -3px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
  line-height:1.5;
}

/* ----- Keyframes ----- */
@keyframes akMbPrestartIn{
  0%{opacity:0;}
  100%{opacity:1;}
}
@keyframes akMbPrestartRise{
  0%{opacity:0.6;transform:translateY(6px);}
  100%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
}
@keyframes akMbPrestartChildRise{
  0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);}
  100%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
}
@keyframes akMbPrestartPulse{
  0%,100%{opacity:0.5;}
  50%{opacity:1;}
}

/* ----- Phase 1.5: Ambient atmosphere keyframes ----- */
@keyframes akMbScanScroll{
  0%{background-position-y:0;}
  100%{background-position-y:160px;}
}
@keyframes akMbGrainDrift{
  0%{background-position:0 0;}
  100%{background-position:160px 80px;}
}
@keyframes akMbVignetteBreathe{
  0%,100%{opacity:1;}
  50%{opacity:0.82;}
}
@keyframes akMbTitleGlow{
  0%,100%{text-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.92),0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.55),0 0 22px rgba(255,51,255,0.07);}
  50%{text-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.92),0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.55),0 0 32px rgba(255,51,255,0.18),0 0 60px rgba(255,51,255,0.06);}
}
@keyframes akMbCtaGlow{
  0%,100%{opacity:0;}
  50%{opacity:1;}
}
@keyframes akMbPlateFlicker{
  0%,100%{opacity:0.28;}
  40%{opacity:0.52;}
  42%{opacity:0.12;}
  44%{opacity:0.46;}
  50%{opacity:0.58;}
}
@keyframes akMbHazePulse{
  0%,100%{opacity:0.06;}
  50%{opacity:0.18;}
}

/* ----- State differentiation: public=colder/eerier, purchased=more energized ----- */
.ak-mb-prestart--purchased::before{
  animation-duration:5s;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 80% at 50% 50%,rgba(255,51,255,0.10) 0%,transparent 70%);
}
.ak-mb-prestart--purchased .ak-mb-prestart__scanline{
  animation-duration:8s;
}
.ak-mb-prestart--purchased .ak-mb-prestart__grain{
  animation-duration:10s;
}
.ak-mb-prestart--purchased .ak-mb-prestart__vignette{
  animation-duration:5s;
}
.ak-mb-prestart--purchased .ak-mb-prestart__title{
  animation-duration:4s;
}
.ak-mb-prestart--purchased .ak-mb-prestart__plate::after{
  animation-duration:4s;
}
.ak-mb-prestart--purchased .ak-mb-prestart__cta--primary::after{
  animation-duration:3.5s;
  box-shadow:0 0 28px -4px rgba(255,51,255,0.32);
}

/* ----- Responsive: tablet ----- */
@media (max-width:640px){
  .ak-mb-prestart{
    padding:18px 16px;
    perspective:none;
  }
  .ak-mb-prestart__inner{
    gap:16px;
    transform:none;
